Quest Mandatory Training Back At Mine
    Events
        Time - Every 5.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (BoomBrotherMineEntrance <gen> contains Nazgrek) Equal to True
                (BoomBrotherMineEntrance <gen> contains Zulkis) Equal to True
        (BoomBrotherMineEntrance <gen> contains BoomBrothers) Equal to True
    Actions
        -------- Check if Boom Brothers are with Player --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Distance between (Position of BoomBrothers) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than or equal to 1000.00
            Then - Actions
                -------- ======== Initial check of the selected unit ======== --------
                Set VariableSet CV = (Custom value of BoomBrothers)
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                            Conditions
                                IsUnitAlive[CV] Equal to False
                                GCSM_UnitInCombat[CV] Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- ======== Cinematic / dialogue cannot be started because of the conditions ======== --------
                        Skip remaining actions
                        -------- ======== ======== --------
                    Else - Actions
                -------- ======== START ======== --------
                Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
                Trigger - Turn off Quest Mandatory Training Chat <gen>
                Trigger - Turn off Quest Mandatory Training Follow <gen>
                -------- ======== Setting ======== --------
                Unit - Order BoomBrothers to Stop.
                Unit - Change ownership of BoomBrothers to Neutral Passive and Retain color
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in BoomBrotherGroup and do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Goblin Miner (Level 10)
                            Then - Actions
                                Unit - Remove (Picked unit) from the game
                            Else - Actions
                -------- ======== CINEMATIC STARTS ======== --------
                Trigger - Run Cinematic ON <gen> (checking conditions)
                -------- Camera --------
                Cinematic - Turn cinematic mode On for (All players)
                Camera - Pan camera for Player 1 (Red) to (Position of BoomBrothers) over 0.00 seconds
                Camera - Apply BoomBrothersCam06 <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
                Wait 1.00 seconds
                Unit - Make BoomBrothers face Nazgrek over 0.75 seconds
                Unit - Make Nazgrek face BoomBrothers over 0.75 seconds
                Wait 1.00 seconds
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Fizz...: Play Boomers_0077 <gen> and display Hey! Where’s Blix....  Modify duration: Set to 4.00 seconds and Wait
                -------- ======== MAD BLIX TIME ======== --------
                -------- create Mad Blix temp unit --------
                Set VariableSet BoomBrothersPoint = (Center of MadBlixPoint1 <gen>)
                Unit - Create 1 Mad Blix for Neutral Passive at BoomBrothersPoint facing Default building facing degrees
                Set VariableSet BossMadBlixTemp = (Last created unit)
                Unit - Add Ghost (Visible) to BossMadBlixTemp
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BoomBrothersPoint)
                -------- issue Mad Blix to move --------
                Set VariableSet BoomBrothersPoint = (Center of BoomBrothersWP01 <gen>)
                Unit - Order BossMadBlixTemp to Move To BoomBrothersPoint
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BoomBrothersPoint)
                Wait 2.00 seconds
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = You fools returned already. 
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("AtexBlix_0058", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from AtexBlix named Mad Blix: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = The mine is now under my control. I am the hazard now.
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("AtexBlix_0059", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from AtexBlix named Mad Blix: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = I knew I smelled rat grease and betrayal!
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Nazgrek_0278", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Nazgrek named Nazgrek: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = He stole OUR MINE?!
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0083", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Fizz...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = We have been deceived. All this safety non-sense was all just to distract us!
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0078", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Fizz...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = You will regret this, Mad Blix!
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0079", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Spro...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from AtexBlix named Mad Blix: Play AtexBlix_0060 <gen> and display Ahahaha!.  Modify duration: Set to 2.65 seconds and Wait
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from AtexBlix named Mad Blix: Play AtexBlix_0061 <gen> and display Fools! I will never....  Modify duration: Set to 3.25 seconds and Wait
                -------- issue Mad Blix to move --------
                Set VariableSet BoomBrothersPoint = (Center of BoomBrothersWP02 <gen>)
                Unit - Order BossMadBlixTemp to Move To BoomBrothersPoint
                Trigger - Turn on Quest Mandatory Training Remove MadBlix <gen>
                Wait 1.00 seconds
                Custom script:   set bj_wantDestroyGroup = true
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in (Units in BoomBrotherMineEntrance <gen>) and do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Turret (Level 10)
                            Then - Actions
                                Unit - Change ownership of (Picked unit) to Player 12 (Brown) and Retain color
                                Unit - Order (Picked unit) to Attack BoomBrothers
                            Else - Actions
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BoomBrothersPoint)
                -------- ======== CINEMATIC ENDS ======== --------
                Trigger - Run Cinematic OFF <gen> (checking conditions)
                Wait Campaign quest delay seconds
                Trigger - Run Quest Mandatory Training Completed <gen> (checking conditions)
                Countdown Timer - Start DialogOverTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 6.00 seconds
            Else - Actions
